## Diagram 1 — Four-Layer System Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph L1["Layer 1 · Input"]
        A1["Phase A: Synthetic video<br/>(OpenCV augmentation,<br/>1,200 labelled clips)"]
        A2["Phase B: Live camera<br/>(webcam / IP / RTSP)"]
    end

    subgraph L2["Layer 2 · Computer Vision"]
        B1["Preprocessor<br/>resize · denoise · normalise"]
        B2["MediaPipe Holistic<br/>33 body + 21x2 hand landmarks"]
        B3["YOLOv8n<br/>tools · PPE · equipment"]
        B4["FrameProcessor<br/>300-dim feature vector"]
    end

    subgraph L3["Layer 3 · Intelligence"]
        C1["ActionRecognizer<br/>MobileNetV3 + 2-layer LSTM"]
        C2["SOP Sequence Tracker<br/>state machine"]
        C3["SOP Deviation Detector<br/>6 classes + severity + WHAT/WHY"]
    end

    subgraph L4["Layer 4 · Feedback & Output"]
        D1["LLM Feedback Engine<br/>6 providers (OpenAI/Groq/<br/>Anthropic/Gemini/xAI/Ollama)"]
        D2["Multi-modal delivery<br/>text overlay + TTS"]
        D3["PostgreSQL<br/>sessions · deviations · profiles"]
        D4["Streamlit Analytics<br/>dashboard + reports"]
    end

    A1 --> B1
    A2 --> B1
    B1 --> B2 --> B4
    B1 --> B3 --> B4
    B4 --> C1 --> C2 --> C3
    C3 -->|deviation + context| D1 --> D2
    C3 --> D3
    D1 --> D3
    D3 --> D4
```

