## Diagram 2 — Real-Time Inference Data Flow (Phase B)

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    CAM(["Camera<br/>~30 fps"]) --> CAP["CameraCapture.read()"]
    CAP --> FP["FrameProcessor"]
    FP --> POSE["Pose landmarks"]
    FP --> OBJ["Object/PPE detection"]
    POSE --> WIN["16-frame sliding window"]
    OBJ --> WIN
    WIN -->|every 4 frames| AR["ActionRecognizer<br/>action_class + confidence"]
    AR --> DET{"SOPDetector<br/>deviation?"}
    DET -->|CORRECT| LOG["update session state"]
    DET -->|deviation,<br/>conf >= 0.6| LLM["LLM feedback<br/>(WHAT + WHY -> instruction)"]
    LLM --> TTS["TTS (pyttsx3)"]
    LLM --> WS["WebSocket -> Streamlit UI"]
    LLM --> DB[("DeviationLog<br/>PostgreSQL")]
    LOG --> WS
    WS --> UI["Live Training page<br/>feedback card + timers"]
    DET -.->|end of session| PERSIST[("TrainingSessionLog<br/>+ WorkerProfile update")]
```

